#: script/lab.js:347
msgid "going in circles? that handprint looks like your own."
msgstr "berputar-putar? bekas tangan itu tampak seperti milikmu sendiri."

#: script/events/road.js:593
msgid "going over there is a detour, in the wrong direction, across the worst of it."
msgstr "pergi ke sana adalah jalan memutar, ke arah yang salah, melintasi bagian terburuknya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1095
msgid "going through the doorway puts you further down than walking around it does."
msgstr "melewati ambang pintu membawamu lebih jauh ke bawah daripada berjalan memutarinya."

#: script/outside.js:907
msgid "good to rebuild"
msgstr "baik untuk dibangun ulang"

#: script/engine.js:466
