#: script/events/encounters.js:1325
msgid "grafted colossus"
msgstr "raksasa cangkokan"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1333
msgid "grafting"
msgstr "mencangkok"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2784
msgid "graves. more of them than the ground should hold, set so close that walking the rows means walking on somebody."
msgstr "kuburan. lebih banyak dari yang seharusnya mampu ditampung tanah, ditata begitu rapat sehingga berjalan di antara barisan berarti berjalan di atas seseorang."

#: script/localization.js:31
msgid "grenade"
msgstr "granat"

#: script/events/path.js:154
msgid "grey ash falls out of a clear sky"
msgstr "abu kelabu jatuh dari langit yang cerah"

#: script/events/path.js:150
msgid "grey falls out of a clear sky for two days."
msgstr "kelabu jatuh dari langit cerah selama dua hari."

#: script/room.js:1136
#: script/room.js:1150
msgid "handheld nuke"
msgstr "bom nuklir genggam"

#: script/lab.js:356
msgid "handprints on the inside of the glass. six fingers, and some with five."
msgstr "bekas tangan di sisi dalam kaca. enam jari, dan sebagian dengan lima."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3620
msgid "hands. not yours. good at what they are doing and doing it fast, and there is a great deal to get through and not much time."
msgstr "tangan-tangan. bukan tanganmu. terampil dalam apa yang mereka lakukan dan melakukannya dengan cepat, dan masih banyak yang harus diselesaikan dengan sedikit waktu."

#: script/events/global.js:21
msgid "hang him"
msgstr "gantung"

#: script/space.js:867
msgid "happy april fools. the door out of here still works and none of this happened."
msgstr "selamat april mop. pintu keluar dari sini masih berfungsi dan semua ini tak pernah terjadi."

#: script/engine.js:1070
#: script/engine.js:1087
#: script/engine.js:213
msgid "hardcore."
msgstr "hardcore."

#: script/fabricator.js:88
msgid "hazard suit"
msgstr "setelan bahaya"

#: script/events/road.js:938
msgid "he arrives at dusk, alone, in armour that was very good once and has not been repaired in living memory."
msgstr "dia tiba saat senja, sendirian, mengenakan zirah yang dulu sangat bagus dan belum pernah diperbaiki selama ingatan siapa pun."

#: script/events/road.js:939
msgid "he arrives exactly at dusk, which he has clearly been doing for a very long time."
msgstr "dia tiba tepat saat senja, yang jelas sudah dilakukannya selama waktu yang sangat lama."

#: script/events/road.js:941
msgid "he arrives with a perfect uniform stride, stepping in his previous footprints."
msgstr "dia tiba dengan langkah seragam yang sempurna, menginjak jejak kakinya sendiri sebelumnya."

#: script/swamp.js:123
msgid "he asks whether anyone came out here with you. he asks it the way you ask a question you already know the answer to."
msgstr "dia bertanya apakah ada orang yang datang ke sini bersamamu. dia bertanya dengan cara seseorang bertanya pertanyaan yang jawabannya sudah dia ketahui."

#: script/events/room.js:967
msgid "he begs for medicine."
msgstr "dia meminta obat."

#: script/events/path.js:594
msgid "he came back up the same path he left by, from the same direction."
msgstr "dia kembali melalui jalur yang sama tempat dia pergi, dari arah yang sama."

#: script/events/path.js:616
msgid "he comes back from the other direction"
msgstr "dia kembali dari arah lain"

#: script/events/room.js:401
msgid "he comes back three days later with a sack, and leaves it at the door."
msgstr "dia kembali tiga hari kemudian dengan sebuah karung, dan meninggalkannya di pintu."

#: script/events/path.js:613
msgid "he comes back up the path from the opposite direction to the one he left in, and he will not talk about it."
msgstr "dia kembali melalui jalur dari arah yang berlawanan dari saat dia pergi, dan dia tak mau membicarakannya."

#: script/events/road.js:940
msgid "he comes out of the dark already walking the line, as though he had never stopped and simply became visible."
msgstr "dia keluar dari kegelapan sudah berjalan di garis itu, seolah dia tak pernah berhenti dan hanya menjadi terlihat."

#: script/events/room.js:925
msgid "he does not answer straight away, and when he does he is not warm about it."
msgstr "dia tidak langsung menjawab, dan ketika dia menjawab tidak dengan hangat."

#: script/events/path.js:631
msgid "he does not come back"
msgstr "dia tidak kembali"

#: script/events/path.js:627
msgid "he does not come back."
msgstr "dia tidak kembali."

#: script/swamp.js:126
msgid "he does not explain that. he says you should ask her, and then says, immediately, that you should not, because she will not tell you either."
msgstr "dia tidak menjelaskan itu. dia berkata kau seharusnya bertanya padanya, lalu segera berkata bahwa kau tak seharusnya, karena dia pun tak akan memberitahumu."

#: script/events/room.js:90
msgid "he does not fight, but the two who were walking a hundred paces behind him do."
msgstr "dia tidak bertarung, tapi kedua orang yang berjalan seratus langkah di belakangnya bertarung."

#: script/events/room.js:114
msgid "he does not fight. he watches, while the bags are cut from his shoulders."
msgstr "dia tidak bertarung. dia mengamati, sementara tas-tas dipotong dari bahunya."

#: script/swamp.js:72
msgid "he does not look at the third charm. he looks at you."
msgstr "dia tidak memandang jimat ketiga. dia memandangmu."

#: script/events/room.js:944
msgid "he does not say who. he leaves before first light."
msgstr "dia tak mengatakan siapa. dia pergi sebelum fajar."

#: script/events/road.js:1593
msgid "he does not surface. shaking him does nothing and shouting does less."
msgstr "dia tak muncul ke permukaan. mengguncangnya tak berbuat apa-apa dan berteriak lebih tidak berguna lagi."

#: script/swamp.js:134
msgid "he does not take the charm this time. he closes your hand around it."
msgstr "kali ini dia tidak mengambil jimatnya. dia menutup tanganmu di sekelilingnya."

#: script/events/room.js:65
msgid "he eats like he has not in days. leaves a token behind."
msgstr "dia makan seolah sudah berhari-hari tidak makan. meninggalkan sebuah kenang-kenangan."

#: script/events/path.js:614
msgid "he gives back what is left of the food. it is most of it. he says he stopped being hungry somewhere out there."
msgstr "dia mengembalikan sisa makanan itu. hampir semuanya. dia berkata dia berhenti merasa lapar di suatu tempat di luar sana."

#: script/events/room.js:1085
msgid "he had nothing to give"
msgstr "dia tak punya apa pun untuk diberikan"

#: script/events/room.js:1362
msgid "he has been walking a long time. he has not once mentioned that anything is still calling him."
msgstr "dia sudah lama berjalan. dia tak sekali pun menyebutkan bahwa ada sesuatu yang masih memanggilnya."

#: script/events/path.js:612
msgid "he is gone eleven days."
msgstr "dia pergi selama sebelas hari."

#: script/events/path.js:538
msgid "he is not raving. he has clearly thought about this a great deal."
msgstr "dia tidak mengoceh. dia jelas telah banyak memikirkan ini."

#: script/events/global.js:94
msgid "he is put on the store room door instead of behind it."
msgstr "dia ditugaskan di pintu gudang, bukan di belakangnya."

#: script/events/room.js:92
msgid "he is slower than he looks right up until he is not."
msgstr "dia lebih lambat dari yang terlihat, sampai tiba-tiba tidak lagi."

#: script/events/path.js:574
msgid "he is talked down"
msgstr "dia diyakinkan untuk turun"

#: script/events/path.js:570
msgid "he is talked down at the bottom of the path and goes back to his hut."
msgstr "dia diyakinkan untuk turun di ujung jalur dan kembali ke gubuknya."

#: script/events/path.js:642
msgid "he is visible for most of the morning, getting smaller, and then he is not."
msgstr "dia terlihat selama hampir seluruh pagi itu, semakin mengecil, lalu tak terlihat lagi."

#: script/events/room.js:121
msgid "he knows this route better than anyone here. he will not be walking it again."
msgstr "dia mengenal rute ini lebih baik dari siapa pun di sini. dia tak akan pernah melewatinya lagi."

#: script/events/room.js:1012
#: script/events/room.js:1028
#: script/events/room.js:1098
msgid "he leaves a reward."
msgstr "dia memberikan hadiah"

#: script/swamp.js:108
msgid "he lets go. says he has done this before, with you, more times than he intends to say out loud."
msgstr "dia melepaskan. dia berkata dia sudah melakukan ini sebelumnya, denganmu, lebih banyak kali dari yang ingin dia katakan dengan lantang."

#: script/events/room.js:814
msgid "he looks at you a while. does not finish the meal. says some debts are not the kind that get paid."
msgstr "dia menatapmu sejenak. tak menghabiskan makanannya. dia berkata sebagian hutang bukan jenis yang bisa dibayar."

#: script/events/room.js:810
msgid "he looks at you a while. says nothing about what he sees."
msgstr "dia menatapmu sejenak. tak berkata apa pun tentang apa yang dia lihat."

#: script/events/room.js:806
msgid "he looks at you a while. says whatever you are carrying, you have been setting it down."
msgstr "dia menatapmu sejenak. dia berkata apa pun yang kau bawa, kau sudah mulai meletakkannya."

#: script/events/room.js:812
msgid "he looks at you a while. says you are carrying something you have not put down."
msgstr "dia menatapmu sejenak. dia berkata kau membawa sesuatu yang belum kau letakkan."

#: script/events/room.js:808
msgid "he looks at you a while. says you are lighter than when you got here."
msgstr "dia menatapmu sejenak. dia berkata kau lebih ringan dari saat kau tiba di sini."

#: script/events/global.js:96
msgid "he never says thank you. he does not need to."
msgstr "dia tak pernah berterima kasih. dia tak perlu melakukannya."

#: script/events/room.js:940
msgid "he puts the cup down and looks at you properly for the first time all evening."
msgstr "dia meletakkan cangkirnya dan menatapmu dengan sungguh-sungguh untuk pertama kalinya sepanjang petang itu."

#: script/swamp.js:61
msgid "he says he has not seen one of these in a long time. that it is a fleet mark, and that there was a fleet."
msgstr "dia berkata sudah lama dia tidak melihat salah satu dari ini. bahwa itu adalah tanda armada, dan bahwa pernah ada sebuah armada."

#: script/events/room.js:910
msgid "he says nothing for a while, and then says he will give you something more useful than a technique."
msgstr "dia tak berkata apa-apa untuk sesaat, lalu berkata dia akan memberimu sesuatu yang lebih berguna dari sebuah teknik."

#: script/events/room.js:116
msgid "he says one sentence in a language nobody here speaks, and then does not say anything else."
msgstr "dia mengucapkan satu kalimat dalam bahasa yang tak ada seorang pun di sini bisa berbicara, lalu tak mengatakan apa pun lagi."

#: script/swamp.js:112
msgid "he says the dying is not even between us."
msgstr "dia berkata kematian bahkan tidak sepadan di antara kita."

#: script/events/room.js:896
msgid "he says the trick is not surviving out here. anyone can do that for a while."
msgstr "dia berkata kuncinya bukan bertahan hidup di sini. siapa pun bisa melakukan itu untuk sementara."

#: script/swamp.js:84
msgid "he says the wars after that were not like the wars before."
msgstr "dia berkata perang-perang setelah itu tidak seperti perang-perang sebelumnya."

#: script/swamp.js:129
msgid "he says the watchers have a phrase about observing fate and rarely changing it, and that they are not wrong, and that they are not much help."
msgstr "dia berkata para pengamat memiliki sebuah ungkapan tentang mengamati takdir dan jarang mengubahnya, dan bahwa mereka tidak salah, dan bahwa mereka tak banyak membantu."

#: script/swamp.js:118
msgid "he says you were not a bad commander. says he has thought about it for what amounts to several lifetimes and keeps arriving at the same place."
msgstr "dia berkata kau bukan komandan yang buruk. dia berkata dia telah memikirkannya selama yang setara dengan beberapa kehidupan dan selalu sampai pada kesimpulan yang sama."

#: script/events/room.js:115
msgid "he sets the bags down himself, before anybody asks him to, and steps back from them."
msgstr "dia sendiri meletakkan tas-tas itu, sebelum ada yang memintanya, lalu mundur menjauh darinya."

#: script/events/room.js:765
msgid "he smiles warmly and asks for lodgings for the night."
msgstr "dia tersenyum dan ingin menginap semalam."

#: script/swamp.js:62
msgid "he speaks of once leading the great fleets to fresh worlds. unfathomable destruction to fuel wanderer hungers."
msgstr "dia berbicara tentang saat dia pernah memimpin armada-armada besar menuju dunia-dunia baru. kehancuran yang tak terbayangkan untuk memuaskan kelaparan para pengembara."

#: script/events/room.js:1047
msgid "he stops fighting well before he stops moving"
msgstr "dia berhenti bertarung jauh sebelum dia berhenti bergerak"

#: script/swamp.js:145
msgid "he takes the charm and sets it with the others, and does not add anything."
msgstr "dia mengambil jimat itu dan menaruhnya bersama yang lain, tanpa menambahkan apa pun."

#: script/swamp.js:106
msgid "he takes the charm, and then he takes your wrist, and turns your hand over to look at the back of it."
msgstr "dia mengambil jimat itu, lalu dia mengambil pergelangan tanganmu, dan membalik tanganmu untuk melihat punggungnya."

#: script/events/room.js:881
msgid "he thinks about it for a long time before he says anything."
msgstr "dia memikirkannya lama sebelum mengatakan apa pun."

#: script/events/room.js:118
msgid "he walks back the way he came, with nothing."
msgstr "dia berjalan kembali ke arah dia datang, tanpa membawa apa pun."

#: script/events/path.js:641
msgid "he walks out at first light with nothing at all."
msgstr "dia keluar saat fajar tanpa membawa apa pun sama sekali."

#: script/events/path.js:645
msgid "he walks out with nothing"
msgstr "dia keluar tanpa membawa apa pun"

#: script/events/road.js:943
msgid "he walks the ring, checks the vent, and starts back. he does not acknowledge anyone."
msgstr "dia berjalan mengelilingi cincin itu, memeriksa ventilasi, dan mulai kembali. dia tak menyapa siapa pun."

#: script/swamp.js:66
msgid "he weighs the second charm against the first, one in each hand, as though checking they match."
msgstr "dia menimbang jimat kedua terhadap yang pertama, satu di setiap tangan, seolah memeriksa apakah keduanya cocok."

#: script/events/global.js:114
msgid "he works the store room door for a week."
msgstr "dia mengerjakan pintu gudang selama seminggu."

#: script/events/outside.js:173
msgid "help her sort it"
msgstr "membantunya menyortirnya"

#: script/outside.js:1562
msgid "her amulet"
msgstr "jimatnya"

#: script/events/room.js:1743
msgid "Her Hands"
msgstr "Tangannya"

#: script/outside.js:1237
msgid "her meloncholy mood departs for a moment."
msgstr "suasana hatinya yang murung menghilang sejenak."

#: script/events/road.js:684
msgid "her pack is beside her, still buckled. she was not out of supplies."
msgstr "ranselnya ada di sampingnya, masih terkunci. dia tidak kehabisan persediaan."

#: script/events/executioner.js:1936
msgid "hinges rusted through. no challenge."
msgstr "engsel berkarat sepenuhnya. tanpa tantangan."

#: script/swamp.js:63
msgid "his time here, now, is his penance."
msgstr "waktunya di sini, sekarang, untuk penebusan dosanya."

#: script/events/encounters.js:805
msgid "hollow monk"
msgstr "biksu berongga"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3673
msgid "hollow warden"
msgstr "penjaga berongga"

#: script/room.js:1473
msgid "hot"
msgstr "memanas"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1247
msgid "housing open"
msgstr "rumah perangkat terbuka"

#: script/events/executioner.js:66
msgid "housing splits"
msgstr "rumah perangkat retak"

#: script/lab.js:346
msgid "how deep do these tunnels go? why is it so cold?"
msgstr "seberapa dalam terowongan ini? mengapa begitu dingin?"

#: script/lab.js:332
msgid "how did the watcher temple have a key to thos place?"
msgstr "bagaimana candi sang pengamat memiliki kunci untuk tempat ini?"

#: script/path.js:176
#: script/path.js:178
msgid "hp"
msgstr "hp"

#: script/world.js:1292
#: script/world.js:369
msgid "hp: {0}/{1}"
msgstr "hp: {0}/{1}"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2228
msgid "hull re-forms"
msgstr "lambung terbentuk kembali"

#: script/ship.js:58
#: script/space.js:44
msgid "hull: "
msgstr "lambung kapal: "

#: script/room.js:296
msgid "hungry mouths crave meat. beasts attack wanderers in the wild. wanderers want to strike back. builder says villagers could help hunt, given the means with a hunting lodge."
msgstr "mulut-mulut lapar mendambakan daging. binatang menyerang pengembara di alam liar. pengembara ingin membalas. pembangun berkata penduduk desa dapat membantu berburu, jika memiliki sarananya dengan pondok berburu."

#: script/events/outside.js:492
msgid "hunt the pack down"
msgstr "memburu kawanan itu"

#: script/localization.js:28
#: script/outside.js:22
msgid "hunter"
msgstr "pemburu"

#: script/room.js:106
#: script/room.js:145
msgid "hut"
msgstr "gubuk"

#: script/engine.js:1072
#: script/engine.js:1084
#: script/engine.js:219
msgid "hyper."
msgstr "hyper."

#: script/fabricator.js:54
msgid "hypo"
msgstr "suntikan"

#: script/room.js:954
msgid "i armour"
msgstr "jirah besi"

#: script/room.js:1560
msgid "I do not claim this to be an extension of Townsend's intent. I intentionally tried to make this story its own."
msgstr "saya tidak mengklaim ini sebagai perpanjangan dari niat Townsend. saya sengaja mencoba membuat cerita ini menjadi milik sendiri."

#: script/events/executioner.js:264
#: script/events/executioner.js:307
msgid "ichor"
msgstr "ichor"

#: script/engine.js:476
msgid "if it is valid, this will replace your current game. that part is irreversible."
msgstr "jika valid, ini akan menggantikan permainanmu saat ini. bagian itu tidak dapat dibatalkan."

#: script/events/executioner.js:1537
msgid "if only they'd been destroyed along with everything else."
msgstr "andai saja mereka juga hancur bersama segala sesuatu yang lain."

#: script/engine.js:475
msgid "if the save is invalid, nothing will be changed."
msgstr "jika data simpanan tidak valid, tak ada yang akan berubah."

#: script/events/road.js:1095
msgid "if you fell here, would anyone find you? was the pack worth it? it nearly cost you dearly."
msgstr "jika kau terjatuh di sini, akankah ada yang menemukanmu? apakah ransel itu sepadan? hampir saja itu membuatmu membayar mahal."

#: script/outside.js:1109
#: script/outside.js:1211
msgid "ignore her"
msgstr "mengabaikannya"

#: script/events/outside.js:264
msgid "ignore it"
msgstr "abaikan"

#: script/events/outside.js:32
#: script/events/room.js:162
#: script/events/room.js:241
msgid "ignore them"
msgstr "abaikan"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2465
msgid "immortal wanderer"
msgstr "pengembara abadi"

#: script/engine.js:443
#: script/engine.js:498
msgid "import"
msgstr "impor"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2435
msgid "in a flash, the figure is standing."
msgstr "dalam sekejap, sosok itu telah berdiri."

#: script/events/room.js:788
msgid "in exchange, the wanderer offers his wisdom."
msgstr "sebagai gantinya, pengembara memberikan ceramah"

#: script/events/room.js:1591
msgid "in its place there is a ration tin, full, and a card with nothing written on it at all."
msgstr "di tempatnya ada sebuah kaleng ransum, penuh, dan sebuah kartu tanpa apa pun yang tertulis di atasnya."

#: script/outside.js:1531
msgid "in the distance soldiers battle over wars long past, some with spears and some with guns. they are unable to let go."
msgstr "di kejauhan para prajurit bertempur dalam perang yang sudah lama berlalu, sebagian dengan tombak dan sebagian dengan senjata api. mereka tak mampu melepaskannya."

#: script/engine.js:1052
