#: script/events/setpieces.js:3144
msgid "on any world where one of those follows the other, that is two thousand years of soil. this is seven inches."
msgstr "di dunia mana pun tempat salah satu dari itu mengikuti yang lain, itu adalah dua ribu tahun lapisan tanah. ini tujuh inci."

#: script/events/global.js:115
msgid "on the eighth morning the door is open, and he is not behind it."
msgstr "pada pagi kedelapan pintu itu terbuka, dan dia tidak ada di baliknya."

#: script/events/room.js:1402
msgid "on the seventh, something answers back."
msgstr "pada yang ketujuh, sesuatu membalas."

#: script/events/outside.js:877
msgid "on the tenth there is a fight at the store room over whose turn it was, and it does not stop at the store room."
msgstr "pada yang kesepuluh terjadi pertengkaran di gudang tentang giliran siapa, dan itu tidak berhenti di gudang."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2763
msgid "on the way out you count the short bank again, and the shorter one after it, and you cannot make either number mean anything except that they did not have to be here."
msgstr "dalam perjalanan keluar kau menghitung deretan pendek itu lagi, dan yang lebih pendek setelahnya, dan kau tak bisa membuat kedua angka itu berarti apa pun kecuali bahwa mereka tak perlu berada di sini."

#: script/events/path.js:590
msgid "one came back after nine days, having walked in what he was certain was a straight line."
msgstr "satu orang kembali setelah sembilan hari, setelah berjalan dalam apa yang dia yakini sebagai garis lurus."

#: script/events/path.js:591
msgid "one came back after two weeks with the same water still in his skin, and could not say why he had not drunk it."
msgstr "satu orang kembali setelah dua minggu dengan air yang sama masih dalam kantong kulitnya, dan tak bisa mengatakan mengapa dia belum meminumnya."

#: script/events/path.js:592
msgid "one came back on the fourth day, walking fast, and would not say what turned him round."
msgstr "satu orang kembali pada hari keempat, berjalan cepat, dan tak mau mengatakan apa yang membuatnya berbalik."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:618
msgid "one chair, facing away"
msgstr "satu kursi, menghadap ke arah lain"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3698
msgid "one corridor. it does not branch, and it is much longer than the building above it should allow."
msgstr "satu koridor. tak bercabang, dan jauh lebih panjang dari yang seharusnya diizinkan oleh bangunan di atasnya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2742
msgid "one holds a man you have met. he is sitting in a cabin in a swamp about four days east of here and he took a charm off you and would not explain why he wanted it."
msgstr "satu memegang seorang pria yang pernah kau temui. dia duduk di sebuah kabin di rawa sekitar empat hari ke timur dari sini dan dia mengambil sebuah jimat darimu dan tak mau menjelaskan mengapa dia menginginkannya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2705
msgid "one is barely anything yet. one is most of the way there. one is finished, and floating, and waiting."
msgstr "satu masih hampir tak berbentuk apa pun. satu sudah hampir selesai. satu sudah rampung, dan mengambang, dan menunggu."

#: script/village.js:216
msgid "one is brought down. the other withdraws in good order, which is somehow worse."
msgstr "satu dijatuhkan. yang lain mundur dengan tertib, yang entah bagaimana lebih buruk."

#: script/events/executioner.js:1028
msgid "one machine thrums with power, and might still work."
msgstr "satu mesin berdengung dengan daya, dan mungkin masih berfungsi."

#: script/graveyard.js:108
msgid "one more stone, at the end of the row, newer than the ones around it."
msgstr "satu batu lagi, di ujung barisan, lebih baru dari yang mengelilinginya."

#: script/events/path.js:67
msgid "one of the crew says her grandmother called this a lean wind, on a world she will not name."
msgstr "salah satu kru berkata neneknya menyebut ini angin kurus, di sebuah dunia yang tak mau dia sebutkan namanya."

#: script/events/executioner.js:132
msgid "one of the defence turrets still works."
msgstr "salah satu menara pertahanan masih berfungsi."

#: script/events/room.js:1553
msgid "one of the hands is yours. the name it wrote is not one you have given anybody here."
msgstr "salah satu tulisan tangan itu adalah milikmu. nama yang ditulisnya bukan nama yang pernah kau berikan kepada siapa pun di sini."

#: script/events/outside.js:990
msgid "one of the newer arrivals can. she reads it twice before she says anything."
msgstr "salah satu pendatang baru bisa. dia membacanya dua kali sebelum mengatakan apa pun."

#: script/village.js:113
msgid "one of the traps catches, and by the time it is noticed the frame is already gone."
msgstr "salah satu jebakan berhasil menangkap, dan pada saat disadari rangkanya sudah hilang."

#: script/events/path.js:536
msgid "one of the villagers is at the bottom of the path with no pack and no water."
msgstr "salah satu penduduk desa berada di ujung jalur tanpa ransel dan tanpa air."

#: script/ruins.js:51
msgid "one of their own opened his door. everyone knows it now, and nothing anybody says after today will be believed again."
msgstr "salah satu dari mereka sendiri membuka pintunya. semua orang mengetahuinya sekarang, dan tak ada yang dikatakan siapa pun setelah hari ini akan dipercaya lagi."

#: script/events/path.js:385
msgid "one of them is being carried, and has been for a while, judging by the other three."
msgstr "salah satu dari mereka sedang digendong, dan sudah lama begitu, dilihat dari ketiga lainnya."

#: script/events/path.js:104
msgid "one of them keeps saying they only meant to be out for the afternoon."
msgstr "salah satu dari mereka terus berkata mereka hanya berniat pergi selama sore hari."

#: script/events/outside.js:775
msgid "one of them offers to prove it and then cannot remember what the proof was."
msgstr "salah satu dari mereka menawarkan untuk membuktikannya lalu tak bisa mengingat apa buktinya."

#: script/events/road.js:1579
msgid "one of them surfaces, briefly"
msgstr "salah satu dari mereka muncul ke permukaan, sebentar"

#: script/events/road.js:1597
msgid "one of them takes hold and does not let go"
msgstr "salah satu dari mereka memegang erat dan tak mau melepaskan"

#: script/events/road.js:793
msgid "one piece comes free. carrying it out takes longer than it should, and the walk back is very bad."
msgstr "satu bagian terlepas. membawanya keluar memakan waktu lebih lama dari seharusnya, dan perjalanan kembali sangat buruk."

#: script/events/road.js:795
msgid "one piece comes out of the wreck"
msgstr "satu bagian keluar dari reruntuhan kapal"

#: script/events/path.js:602
msgid "one walked straight and came back the way he left"
msgstr "satu berjalan lurus dan kembali dengan cara yang sama seperti saat dia pergi"

#: script/events/outside.js:368
msgid "only a few die."
msgstr "hanya sedikit yang mati."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4959
msgid "only dust and stains remain."
msgstr "hanya debu dan noda yang tersisa."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7387
msgid "only the chief remains."
msgstr "hanya terdapat kepala desa."

#: script/events/room.js:1490
msgid "open it"
msgstr "membukanya"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1609
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2689
msgid "open the door"
msgstr "membuka pintu"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1690
msgid "open the inner door"
msgstr "membuka pintu dalam"

#: script/events/outside.js:131
msgid "open the stores"
msgstr "membuka gudang"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3310
msgid "opening it bare-handed is not a decision. it is just a way of dying in a shed."
msgstr "membukanya dengan tangan kosong bukanlah sebuah keputusan. itu hanyalah cara untuk mati di sebuah gudang."

#: script/engine.js:435
msgid "or migrating computers"
msgstr "atau memindahkan komputer"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5014
msgid "orange traffic cones are set across the street, faded and cracked."
msgstr "kerucut-kerucut lalu lintas berada di jalan, luntur dan retak."

#: script/outside.js:1375
msgid "other wanderers"
msgstr "pengembara lainnya"

#: script/events/room.js:1054
msgid "others cower in the distance"
msgstr "yang lain meringkuk ketakutan di kejauhan"

#: script/room.js:2068
msgid "others have followed you before and suffered or been left behind."
msgstr "yang lain pernah mengikutimu sebelumnya dan menderita atau tertinggal."

#: script/outside.js:5
msgid "Outside"
msgstr "Luar"

#: script/events/road.js:214
msgid "over the top of the stamped ones, newer and shallower, somebody has cut the same three letters again and again."
msgstr "di atas yang tercap, lebih baru dan lebih dangkal, seseorang telah mengukir tiga huruf yang sama berulang-ulang."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3059
msgid "overcharging"
msgstr "kelebihan muatan"

#: script/room.js:1475
msgid "overheating"
msgstr "kepanasan"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:510
msgid "overload"
msgstr "kelebihan beban"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4510
#: script/events/setpieces.js:5351
msgid "overreaches"
msgstr "terlalu memaksakan diri"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1512
msgid "pace quickening"
msgstr "langkah semakin cepat"

#: script/events/encounters.js:644
msgid "pack of beasts"
msgstr "kawanan binatang"

#: script/events/path.js:35
msgid "pack through it"
msgstr "menerobos melewatinya"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:268
msgid "paired lumen"
msgstr "lumen berpasangan"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1275
msgid "panoply"
msgstr "perlengkapan lengkap"

#: script/events/road.js:1551
msgid "past that line there is nothing kneeling and nothing standing and nothing at all."
msgstr "melewati garis itu tak ada yang berlutut dan tak ada yang berdiri dan tak ada apa pun sama sekali."

#: script/events/executioner.js:1570
msgid "past the checkpoint, banks of containment cells can be seen."
msgstr "melewati pos pemeriksaan, deretan sel penampungan dapat terlihat."

#: script/events/executioner.js:1776
msgid "past the checkpoint, the corridor is undamaged save for sporadic graffiti."
msgstr "melewati pos pemeriksaan, koridor tak rusak kecuali grafiti yang sporadis."

#: script/engine.js:491
msgid "paste the save code here, or choose a file below."
msgstr "tempel kode simpanan di sini, atau pilih berkas di bawah."

#: script/events.js:371
msgid "pause."
msgstr "jeda."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2831
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2852
msgid "pay your respects"
msgstr "memberikan penghormatan"

