#: script/events/global.js:15
msgid "say he should be strung up as an example."
msgstr "mengatakan dia seharusnya digantung sebagai contoh."

#: script/events/global.js:14
msgid "say his folk have been skimming the supplies."
msgstr "mengatakan rekannya telah mencuri persediaan."

#: script/events/room.js:1146
msgid "say nobody knows"
msgstr "mengatakan tak seorang pun tahu"

#: script/events/room.js:1348
#: script/events/room.js:1389
#: script/events/room.js:933
#: script/events/room.js:949
#: script/room.js:2149
msgid "say nothing"
msgstr "tidak mengatakan apa-apa"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1891
msgid "say that you are short"
msgstr "mengatakan bahwa kau kekurangan"

#: script/swamp.js:91
msgid "says a small number of people stood up when the sentence was read, and that standing up did not help, and that the same sentence was read over them."
msgstr "dia berkata sejumlah kecil orang berdiri saat sentensi dibacakan, dan bahwa berdiri tidak membantu, dan bahwa sentensi yang sama dibacakan atas mereka."

#: script/events/room.js:927
msgid "says actions out here have consequences, and that the consequences do not arrive as punishment. they arrive as doors that are already shut when you get to them."
msgstr "dia berkata tindakan di sini memiliki konsekuensi, dan konsekuensi itu tidak datang sebagai hukuman. mereka datang sebagai pintu-pintu yang sudah tertutup saat kau mencapainya."

#: script/events/room.js:942
msgid "says consequences are not a threat he is making. they are a thing that has already started, and you will feel it as luck turning against you, and you will call it luck."
msgstr "dia berkata konsekuensi bukanlah ancaman yang sedang dia buat. itu adalah sesuatu yang sudah dimulai, dan kau akan merasakannya sebagai keberuntungan yang berbalik melawanmu, dan kau akan menyebutnya keberuntungan."

#: script/events/room.js:1189
msgid "says every settlement gives her a different name, and the older the settlement, the less certain they are."
msgstr "dia berkata setiap permukiman memberinya nama yang berbeda, dan semakin tua permukiman itu, semakin tidak yakin mereka."

#: script/events/room.js:911
msgid "says everything you do out here is done in front of somebody, and that they carry it further than you do."
msgstr "dia berkata segala sesuatu yang kau lakukan di sini dilakukan di depan seseorang, dan mereka membawanya lebih jauh darimu."

#: script/events/room.js:457
msgid "says he can build you a hut for less wood"
msgstr "berkata dia dapat membangunkanmu gubuk dengan lebih sedikit kayu"

#: script/events/room.js:926
msgid "says he has been to three settlements this season and your name came up at two of them, and not well."
msgstr "dia berkata dia telah mengunjungi tiga permukiman musim ini dan namamu muncul di dua di antaranya, dan tidak baik."

#: script/swamp.js:113
msgid "says he has gone perhaps a dozen times, and each one took a little off the top, and he can still tell you the name of the ship he was born on."
msgstr "dia berkata dia sudah pergi mungkin belasan kali, dan setiap kali mengambil sedikit dari puncaknya, dan dia masih bisa memberitahumu nama kapal tempat dia lahir."

#: script/events/room.js:943
msgid "says he has seen someone do all of this before, at a scale you would not believe, and that they are still paying for it."
msgstr "dia berkata dia pernah melihat seseorang melakukan semua ini sebelumnya, dalam skala yang tak akan kau percaya, dan mereka masih membayarnya."

#: script/events/path.js:537
msgid "says he is going to walk until he reaches the edge of it. says he has worked out that there has to be one."
msgstr "dia berkata dia akan berjalan sampai mencapai tepinya. dia berkata dia telah menyimpulkan pasti ada tepinya."

#: script/space.js:980
msgid "says he is prepared to follow you again, if you will have him. says the last time did not go especially well and that he has had four hundred centuries to think about what he would do differently."
msgstr "dia berkata dia siap mengikutimu lagi, jika kau menerimanya. dia berkata terakhir kali tidak berjalan begitu baik dan dia telah memiliki empat ratus abad untuk memikirkan apa yang akan dia lakukan berbeda."

#: script/events/room.js:941
msgid "says he knows what you have been doing. says everyone between here and the flats knows what you have been doing."
msgstr "dia berkata dia tahu apa yang telah kau lakukan. dia berkata semua orang antara sini dan dataran itu tahu apa yang telah kau lakukan."

#: script/swamp.js:73
msgid "says he served under a commander he would have followed anywhere and largely did."
msgstr "dia berkata dia bertugas di bawah seorang komandan yang akan dia ikuti ke mana pun dan sebagian besar memang begitu."

#: script/swamp.js:92
msgid "says he was one. says there was one other, and she is not here, and he does not say more than that."
msgstr "dia berkata dia adalah salah satunya. dia berkata ada satu orang lagi, dan dia tak ada di sini, dan dia tak mengatakan lebih dari itu."

#: script/swamp.js:136
msgid "says he will be here. says that is not a promise, it is just the only fact he has left."
msgstr "dia berkata dia akan berada di sini. dia berkata itu bukan janji, itu hanya satu-satunya fakta yang tersisa baginya."

#: script/room.js:2129
msgid "says in that case the huts should be built to last, and that she knows how, given steel."
msgstr "dia berkata dalam hal itu gubuk-gubuk harus dibangun untuk bertahan lama, dan dia tahu caranya, jika ada baja."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2452
msgid "says it can't die."
msgstr "berkata itu tak bisa mati."

#: script/events/outside.js:168
msgid "says it is not the first thing she has had to rebuild. says that is not much comfort and offers it anyway."
msgstr "dia berkata itu bukan hal pertama yang harus dia bangun ulang. dia berkata itu tidak terlalu menghibur tapi tetap menawarkannya."

#: script/room.js:2130
msgid "says people work better when they are not waiting for the roof to come down."
msgstr "dia berkata orang bekerja lebih baik ketika mereka tidak menunggu atap runtuh."

#: script/events/road.js:666
msgid "says she has stopped believing the answers and started keeping a list of who gave them."
msgstr "dia berkata dia sudah berhenti percaya pada jawaban-jawaban itu dan mulai membuat daftar siapa yang memberikannya."

#: script/room.js:2114
msgid "says she has watched people follow you before. says she has watched what it cost them."
msgstr "dia berkata dia pernah menyaksikan orang-orang mengikutimu sebelumnya. dia berkata dia pernah menyaksikan apa harganya bagi mereka."

#: script/events/road.js:665
msgid "says she is going to go back and ask better questions."
msgstr "dia berkata dia akan kembali dan mengajukan pertanyaan yang lebih baik."

#: script/events/road.js:664
msgid "says she is going to try north next, when she can walk properly."
msgstr "dia berkata dia akan mencoba ke utara selanjutnya, saat dia bisa berjalan dengan baik."

#: script/events/room.js:1135
msgid "says she is making a register of settlements. asks what this one is called."
msgstr "dia berkata dia sedang membuat daftar permukiman. bertanya apa nama tempat ini."

#: script/room.js:2075
msgid "says she is not asking to be difficult. says the answer changes what she builds next."
msgstr "dia berkata dia tidak bertanya untuk mempersulit. dia berkata jawabannya mengubah apa yang akan dia bangun selanjutnya."

#: script/events/road.js:662
msgid "says she walked east because the last three people she asked all said something different, and east was the only direction nobody had ruled out."
msgstr "dia berkata dia berjalan ke timur karena tiga orang terakhir yang dia tanya semuanya mengatakan hal berbeda, dan timur adalah satu-satunya arah yang tak ada seorang pun yang menyingkirkannya."

#: script/events/room.js:1778
msgid "says thank you once, plainly, and then talks about something else for the rest of the evening."
msgstr "mengucapkan terima kasih sekali, dengan jelas, lalu membicarakan hal lain untuk sisa petang itu."

#: script/events/room.js:883
msgid "says that is worth more than any of the three things he taught you, and that it took longer to earn."
msgstr "dia berkata itu lebih berharga dari tiga hal yang dia ajarkan padamu, dan itu butuh waktu lebih lama untuk didapatkan."

#: script/events/room.js:882
msgid "says that people out here talk, and that what they say about this village has started arriving before you do."
msgstr "dia berkata orang-orang di sini berbicara, dan apa yang mereka katakan tentang desa ini sudah mulai tiba sebelum dirimu."

#: script/events/road.js:669
msgid "says that sometimes all you can do is commit to a direction to avoid madness."
msgstr "dia berkata terkadang yang bisa kau lakukan hanyalah berkomitmen pada satu arah untuk menghindari kegilaan."

#: script/swamp.js:74
msgid "says the commander was not cruel. says that is what made the rest of it possible -- nobody follows a monster in those numbers."
msgstr "dia berkata komandan itu tidak kejam. dia berkata itulah yang membuat selebihnya mungkin -- tak ada yang mengikuti monster dalam jumlah sebanyak itu."

#: script/events/road.js:668
msgid "says the compass in your hand shows more than hers."
msgstr "dia berkata kompas di tanganmu menunjukkan lebih banyak dari miliknya."

#: script/swamp.js:130
msgid "says the cycle is not a punishment anybody is still administering. says whoever passed the sentence is four hundred centuries dead and the machine is simply still running."
msgstr "dia berkata siklus itu bukan hukuman yang masih dijalankan siapa pun. dia berkata siapa pun yang menjatuhkan hukuman itu sudah mati empat ratus abad dan mesinnya hanya sekadar masih berjalan."

#: script/swamp.js:86
msgid "says the fleet is gone. not scattered -- gone. says there is no wanderer society left to go back to, and that most of what is buried on this rock is the last of it."
msgstr "dia berkata armada itu telah lenyap. bukan tercerai-berai -- lenyap. dia berkata tak ada lagi masyarakat pengembara yang tersisa untuk kembali, dan sebagian besar yang terkubur di batu ini adalah yang terakhir darinya."

#: script/events/room.js:1190
msgid "says the oldest ones do not give a name at all. they just point at the ground."
msgstr "dia berkata yang tertua sama sekali tidak memberi nama. mereka hanya menunjuk ke tanah."

#: script/space.js:979
msgid "says the terms were never as fixed as he let you believe. says he stayed because he had nowhere he would rather be broken, and that this, apparently, is not that any more."
msgstr "dia berkata persyaratannya tidak pernah setetap yang dia biarkan kau percayai. dia berkata dia tinggal karena tak ada tempat lain yang lebih dia sukai untuk dihancurkan, dan ini, ternyata, sudah bukan itu lagi."

#: script/room.js:2115
msgid "says the traps will still fill. says she can salt what comes out of them, and that two people do not need a village to feed them."
msgstr "dia berkata jebakan akan tetap terisi. dia berkata dia bisa mengasinkan apa yang keluar darinya, dan dua orang tidak membutuhkan desa untuk memberi mereka makan."

#: script/events/room.js:897
msgid "says the trick is what you are still willing to do by the time you have."
msgstr "dia berkata kuncinya adalah apa yang masih kau rela lakukan pada saat kau sudah melakukannya."

#: script/events/room.js:913
msgid "says the wild is not the thing that decides how this goes."
msgstr "dia berkata alam liar bukanlah yang menentukan bagaimana ini berjalan."

#: script/swamp.js:67
msgid "says the worlds were not empty. says that is the part people leave out when they tell it."
msgstr "dia berkata dunia-dunia itu tidak kosong. dia berkata itulah bagian yang dilewatkan orang saat menceritakannya."

#: script/swamp.js:79
msgid "says there was another after that. one who thought the fleets were being wasted on conquest that stopped."
msgstr "dia berkata ada satu lagi setelah itu. seseorang yang berpikir armada-armada itu terbuang sia-sia dalam penaklukan yang terhenti."

#: script/swamp.js:80
msgid "says they locked that one up, and they were right to, and everyone agreed, and it held for a long time."
msgstr "dia berkata mereka mengunci yang itu, dan mereka benar melakukannya, dan semua orang setuju, dan itu bertahan lama."

#: script/events/outside.js:846
msgid "says this world is the only one that never got a name, and that is why they are all still on it."
msgstr "dia berkata dunia ini adalah satu-satunya yang tak pernah mendapat nama, dan itulah sebabnya mereka semua masih di sini."

#: script/events/path.js:572
msgid "says two of them went anyway."
msgstr "dia berkata dua di antara mereka tetap pergi."

#: script/events/room.js:898
msgid "says you are doing better at that than most, and that most is not a high bar, and that he means it kindly."
msgstr "dia berkata kau melakukannya lebih baik dari kebanyakan, dan kebanyakan itu bukan standar yang tinggi, dan dia bermaksud baik mengatakannya."

#: script/events/road.js:667
msgid "says you cant always trust your memory of where you have been before. take notes."
msgstr "dia berkata kau tak selalu bisa mempercayai ingatanmu tentang di mana kau pernah berada. buatlah catatan."

#: script/events/room.js:912
msgid "says you have a reputation. says it is not a bad one yet, and that yet is doing a great deal of work in that sentence."
msgstr "dia berkata kau punya reputasi. dia berkata itu belum buruk, dan kata \"belum\" itu memiliki banyak arti dalam kalimat itu."

#: script/swamp.js:114
msgid "says you have gone so many times the furnace downstairs keeps a book on it."
msgstr "dia berkata kau sudah pergi begitu banyak kali sehingga tungku di bawah menyimpan catatannya."

#: script/events/room.js:928
msgid "says you still have time to change what people say. says it will take longer than earning it did."
msgstr "dia berkata kau masih punya waktu untuk mengubah apa yang dikatakan orang. dia berkata itu akan membutuhkan waktu lebih lama dari mendapatkannya dahulu."

#: script/swamp.js:119
msgid "says you were a good one, doing a thing that should not have been done, extremely well."
msgstr "dia berkata kau adalah orang yang baik, melakukan hal yang seharusnya tak dilakukan, dengan sangat baik."

#: script/localization.js:45
#: script/localization.js:50
msgid "scales"
msgstr "sisik"

#: script/outside.js:117
msgid "scattered teeth"
msgstr "gigi-gigi bertaburan"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1500
msgid "scavenge maps"
msgstr "menjarah peta"

#: script/events/encounters.js:239
msgid "scavenger"
msgstr "pemulung"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4788
msgid "scavenger had a small camp in the school."
msgstr "pemulung membuat perkemahan di dalam sekolah."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4831
msgid "scavenger'd been looking for supplies in here, it seems."
msgstr "pemulung telah mencari-cari persediaan di sini, sepertinya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6283
msgid "scavengers must have gotten to this place already."
msgstr "para pemulung pasti telah tiba di tempat ini."

#: script/outside.js:1548
msgid "scavening wanderers pick over the bodies on an old battlefield. a wanderer finds a dead human in shining armor. they are disappointed they can't use the armor because it only has two arms."
msgstr "para pengembara penjarah menggeledah mayat-mayat di medan perang lama. seorang pengembara menemukan manusia mati mengenakan zirah berkilau. mereka kecewa tak bisa menggunakan zirah itu karena hanya memiliki dua lengan."

#: script/outside.js:1159
msgid "scoff at her weakness"
msgstr "mengejek kelemahannya"

#: script/space.js:1176
msgid "score for this game: {0}"
msgstr "skor untuk permainan ini: {0}"

#: script/engine.js:57
#: script/events/encounters.js:565
msgid "scout"
msgstr "intai"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4702
msgid "scrap plating"
msgstr "pelapisan baja tua"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2149
msgid "scrape the rim"
msgstr "mengerok tepiannya"

#: script/events/executioner.js:403
msgid "scraps of copper wire litter the floor."
msgstr "potongan-potongan kawat tembaga berserakan di lantai."

#: script/outside.js:102
msgid "scraps of fur"
msgstr "potongan bulu"

#: script/outside.js:135
msgid "scraps of iron"
msgstr "potongan-potongan besi"

#: script/events/road.js:319
msgid "scratched into the underside of the rock, where somebody lying exactly here would see it, there is a line of marks."
msgstr "terukir di sisi bawah batu, di tempat seseorang yang berbaring persis di sini akan melihatnya, ada sederet tanda."

#: script/events/road.js:541
msgid "scratched on the underside of the middle stone there is a list of marks in different hands."
msgstr "terukir di sisi bawah batu tengah ada daftar tanda dengan tulisan tangan berbeda-beda."

#: script/prison.js:231
msgid "scratches on a sloped face, made by someone lying down."
msgstr "goresan pada permukaan miring, dibuat oleh seseorang yang berbaring."

#: script/events/room.js:223
msgid "scratching noises can be heard from the store room."
msgstr "suara cakaran dapat terdengar dari gudang."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:634
msgid "scribe"
msgstr "juru tulis"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1288
msgid "sealed"
msgstr "tersegel"

#: script/fabricator.js:92
msgid "sealed at every seam. the counter on the chest goes quiet."
msgstr "tersegel di setiap jahitan. penghitung di dada menjadi diam."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1249
msgid "sealing"
msgstr "menyegel"

#: script/events/road.js:1627
msgid "search it"
msgstr "menggeledahnya"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2945
msgid "search the records"
msgstr "mencari catatan"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6395
msgid "searching the bodies yields a few supplies."
msgstr "terdapat beberapa persediaan di tubuh-tubuh mayat."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1010
msgid "seated one"
msgstr "yang duduk"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2160
msgid "security drones still patrol the hallways."
msgstr "drone keamanan masih berpatroli di lorong-lorong."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2060
msgid "security is even tighter here."
msgstr "keamanan bahkan lebih ketat di sini."

#: script/engine.js:58
msgid "see farther"
msgstr "melihat lebih jauh"

#: script/events/outside.js:598
msgid "see to our own dead first"
msgstr "mengurus orang mati kita sendiri dahulu"

#: script/outside.js:1429
msgid "seeing it in their eyes. some fear or resent you. but why?"
msgstr "melihatnya di mata mereka. beberapa takut atau membencimu. tapi mengapa?"

#: script/events/executioner.js:99
msgid "self-repair"
msgstr "perbaikan mandiri"

#: script/events/room.js:1155
msgid "send her on"
msgstr "menyuruhnya melanjutkan"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:239
msgid "sentinel"
msgstr "sentinel"

#: script/events/outside.js:258
msgid "separate the sick"
msgstr "memisahkan yang sakit"

#: script/events/executioner.js:59
msgid "servos spin up"
msgstr "servo mulai berputar"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3485
msgid "set the three in the floor"
msgstr "menempatkan ketiganya di lantai"

#: script/events/executioner.js:357
#: script/events/setpieces.js:7200
msgid "sets himself"
msgstr "memposisikan dirinya"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5881
msgid "sets itself"
msgstr "memposisikan dirinya"

#: script/mobileUI.js:299
msgid "settings"
msgstr "pengaturan"

#: script/events/encounters.js:165
msgid "shadow"
msgstr "bayangan"

#: script/events/encounters.js:157
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "Bayangan"

#: script/events/room.js:1064
msgid "shamefully gather goods"
msgstr "mengumpulkan barang dengan malu"

#: script/engine.js:854
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Bagi"

#: script/events/room.js:59
msgid "share a meal"
msgstr "berbagi makanan"

#: script/engine.js:231
msgid "share."
msgstr "bagi."

#: script/events/global.js:76
msgid "shares what he knows about sneaking before he goes."
msgstr "berbagi apa yang dia ketahui tentang menyelinap sebelum dia pergi."

#: script/room.js:1006
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make even stronger steel armour for protection."
msgstr "gigi tajam, mulut lapar dan hati yang penuh kekerasan mendambakan darah. pembangun dapat membuat zirah baja yang bahkan lebih kuat untuk perlindungan."

#: script/room.js:971
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make stronger iron armour for protection. she likes to see you protected."
msgstr "gigi tajam, mulut lapar dan hati yang penuh kekerasan mendambakan darah. pembangun dapat membuat zirah besi yang lebih kuat untuk perlindungan. dia senang melihatmu terlindungi."

#: script/room.js:936
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can stitch together leather armour for protection. she worries about you."
msgstr "gigi tajam, mulut lapar dan hati yang penuh kekerasan mendambakan darah. pembangun dapat menjahit zirah kulit untuk perlindungan. dia mengkhawatirkanmu."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2331
msgid "she asked you not to, and you agreed, and that is the end of it for now."
msgstr "dia memintamu untuk tidak melakukannya, dan kau setuju, dan itulah akhirnya untuk saat ini."

#: script/builder.js:189
msgid "she asks how thick the layers were. when you tell her, she goes quiet in the specific way she goes quiet when a number means something to her that it does not mean to you."
msgstr "dia bertanya seberapa tebal lapisannya. ketika kau memberitahunya, dia menjadi diam dengan cara khusus dia menjadi diam saat sebuah angka berarti sesuatu baginya yang tidak berarti bagimu."

#: script/builder.js:193
msgid "she asks how you got in. you tell her about the six handprints and she stops what she is doing entirely. says that is not a lock, that is a quorum, and that nobody was ever meant to open that door on their own -- and then does not ask the obvious next question, and you both let her not ask it."
msgstr "dia bertanya bagaimana kau masuk. kau memberitahunya tentang enam bekas tangan itu dan dia sepenuhnya berhenti melakukan apa yang sedang dia lakukan. dia berkata itu bukan kunci, itu adalah kuorum, dan tak seorang pun dimaksudkan untuk membuka pintu itu sendirian -- lalu dia tak mengajukan pertanyaan lanjutan yang jelas, dan kalian berdua membiarkannya tidak bertanya."

#: script/builder.js:185
msgid "she asks if the stars looked right. when you tell her they did not, she nods like that confirms something she already suspected and declines to say what."
msgstr "dia bertanya apakah bintang-bintangnya terlihat benar. ketika kau memberitahunya tidak, dia mengangguk seolah itu menegaskan sesuatu yang sudah dia curigai dan menolak mengatakan apa itu."

#: script/builder.js:169
msgid "she asks what they were like. not what they said -- what they were LIKE. says she has never been sure whether watching is a kindness or the absence of one, and that she has had a long time to decide and has not."
msgstr "dia bertanya seperti apa mereka. bukan apa yang mereka katakan -- SEPERTI APA mereka. dia berkata dia tak pernah yakin apakah mengamati adalah sebuah kebaikan atau ketidakadaan darinya, dan dia telah memiliki banyak waktu untuk memutuskan dan belum juga."

#: script/events/road.js:1569
msgid "she asks whether it is over. told that nobody knows what \"it\" is, she says that is the correct answer and seems satisfied by it."
msgstr "dia bertanya apakah sudah berakhir. diberitahu bahwa tak seorang pun tahu apa \"itu\", dia berkata itu adalah jawaban yang benar dan tampak puas dengannya."

#: script/builder.js:197
msgid "she asks you to say the charter again, slowly, and mouths the last line along with you the second time. says she did not know anyone had written that down. says somebody should have."
msgstr "dia memintamu untuk mengucapkan piagam itu lagi, perlahan, dan menggerakkan bibirnya mengikuti baris terakhir bersamamu untuk kedua kalinya. dia berkata dia tak tahu ada orang yang menuliskan itu. dia berkata seharusnya memang ada yang menuliskannya."

#: script/builder.js:142
msgid "she banks it without being asked, out of habit, before she has even said anything about it. says a fire is the first thing and the last thing, whichever world you are having this argument on."
msgstr "dia menimbunnya tanpa diminta, karena kebiasaan, sebelum dia bahkan mengatakan apa pun tentangnya. dia berkata api adalah hal pertama dan hal terakhir, dunia mana pun tempat kau berdebat tentang ini."

#: script/outside.js:1066
msgid "she bolts upright and awake."
msgstr "dia bangun tegak dan terjaga secara tiba-tiba."

#: script/builder.js:221
msgid "she builds what is asked for and does not argue about it. says only that she has seen a place run this way before, and that she was not one of the people running it."
msgstr "dia membangun apa yang diminta dan tak membantahnya. dia hanya berkata dia pernah melihat sebuah tempat dijalankan seperti ini sebelumnya, dan dia bukan salah satu orang yang menjalankannya."

#: script/builder.js:181
msgid "she checks you over before she says a word, the way she would check a wound. says glass like that does not happen on its own, and that whatever did it to the ground would have done the same to a person standing on it."
msgstr "dia memeriksamu sebelum mengatakan sepatah kata pun, sebagaimana dia akan memeriksa sebuah luka. dia berkata kaca seperti itu tidak terbentuk dengan sendirinya, dan apa pun yang melakukannya pada tanah itu akan melakukan hal yang sama pada seseorang yang berdiri di atasnya."

#: script/events/road.js:1565
msgid "she comes back slowly, the way somebody surfaces rather than wakes."
msgstr "dia kembali perlahan, sebagaimana seseorang muncul ke permukaan daripada terbangun."

#: script/builder.js:228
msgid "she counts them twice, which does not change the number. says she does not know any of their names, and that this is the part she cannot get used to."
msgstr "dia menghitung mereka dua kali, yang tidak mengubah jumlahnya. dia berkata dia tak tahu nama satu pun dari mereka, dan inilah bagian yang tak bisa dia biasakan."

#: script/events/room.js:1273
msgid "she does not argue. she writes something in the book, closes it, and walks."
msgstr "dia tak membantah. dia menulis sesuatu dalam buku itu, menutupnya, dan berjalan pergi."

#: script/room.js:2143
msgid "she does not argue. that is the part worth noticing."
msgstr "dia tak membantah. itulah bagian yang patut diperhatikan."

#: script/builder.js:165
msgid "she does not ask if you are alright. she can see that you are not, entirely. says a ship like that does not get built for one purpose, and asks, quietly, which purpose found you."
msgstr "dia tak bertanya apakah kau baik-baik saja. dia bisa melihat bahwa kau tidak, sepenuhnya. dia berkata kapal seperti itu tidak dibangun untuk satu tujuan, dan bertanya, dengan pelan, tujuan mana yang menemukanmu."

#: script/builder.js:118
msgid "she does not ask what happened out there. she can see most of it. says the wastes kill people on their own without any help from us, and that maybe there is another way, and that she knows how that sounds."
msgstr "dia tak bertanya apa yang terjadi di luar sana. dia bisa melihat sebagian besarnya. dia berkata tanah tandus itu membunuh orang dengan sendirinya tanpa bantuan kita, dan mungkin ada cara lain, dan dia tahu bagaimana kedengarannya itu."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2362
msgid "she does not explain how she found you. she asks you not to open the door."
msgstr "dia tak menjelaskan bagaimana dia menemukanmu. dia memintamu untuk tidak membuka pintu itu."

#: script/room.js:2142
msgid "she does not nod. she looks at the hut, and then at you, and then goes back to work."
msgstr "dia tak mengangguk. dia menatap gubuk itu, lalu menatapmu, lalu kembali bekerja."

#: script/builder.js:177
msgid "she does not say i told you so, and you can see what it costs her not to. says she is glad you are standing in front of her and asks nothing else, and you understand that not asking is the kindness."
msgstr "dia tak berkata sudah kubilang, dan kau bisa melihat betapa itu berat baginya untuk tidak mengatakannya. dia berkata dia senang kau berdiri di depannya dan tak bertanya apa pun lagi, dan kau memahami bahwa tidak bertanya adalah kebaikannya."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1704
msgid "she does not say it unkindly. she goes back to the racks."
msgstr "dia tak mengatakannya dengan kasar. dia kembali ke rak-rak."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2383
msgid "she does not say thank you. she does not say anything at all for the first hour of the walk."
msgstr "dia tak berterima kasih. dia tak mengatakan apa pun sama sekali selama jam pertama perjalanan."

#: script/events/room.js:1261
msgid "she eats, and thanks the village, and has nothing to leave behind but the thanks."
msgstr "dia makan, dan berterima kasih pada desa, dan tak punya apa pun untuk ditinggalkan selain ucapan terima kasih."

#: script/outside.js:1068
msgid "she fails to hide her anger."
msgstr "dia gagal menyembunyikan kemarahannya."

#: script/events/road.js:623
msgid "she gets the water down and then most of an hour later she can stand."
msgstr "dia meminum air itu lalu hampir satu jam kemudian dia bisa berdiri."

#: script/events/road.js:633
msgid "she gives up what is left in her pack, which is not much, and starts back the way she came."
msgstr "dia menyerahkan apa yang tersisa di ranselnya, yang tidak banyak, dan mulai kembali ke arah dia datang."

#: script/builder.js:160
msgid "she goes very still when you describe him. says she knows exactly who that is, and what he signed, and that neither of those is the part that matters to her. says he was one of the two who stood up when the sentence was read. she does not say who the other one was."
msgstr "dia menjadi sangat diam saat kau mendeskripsikannya. dia berkata dia tahu persis siapa itu, dan apa yang dia tanda tangani, dan tak satu pun dari itu adalah bagian yang penting baginya. dia berkata dia adalah salah satu dari dua orang yang berdiri saat sentensi dibacakan. dia tak mengatakan siapa yang satu lagi."

#: script/builder.js:218
msgid "she has been quieter since the huts went up, and it is a better quiet. says she has built for people who were being kept before. says this is not that."
msgstr "dia menjadi lebih tenang sejak gubuk-gubuk didirikan, dan ini kesunyian yang lebih baik. dia berkata dia pernah membangun untuk orang-orang yang ditahan sebelumnya. dia berkata ini bukan itu."

#: script/events/road.js:628
msgid "she has been rationing to a schedule she wrote out beforehand. the schedule assumed the water would be where the map said."
msgstr "dia telah menjatah sesuai jadwal yang ditulisnya sebelumnya. jadwal itu mengasumsikan air akan berada di tempat yang dikatakan peta."

#: script/events/road.js:625
msgid "she has been walking east for eleven days on four days of supplies, which she is aware does not work."
msgstr "dia telah berjalan ke timur selama sebelas hari dengan persediaan untuk empat hari, yang dia sadari tidak masuk akal."

#: script/events/road.js:626
msgid "she has been walking since a settlement that she names, and that nobody has heard of, and that she is certain is two days behind her."
msgstr "dia telah berjalan sejak sebuah permukiman yang dia sebutkan namanya, dan yang tak seorang pun pernah dengar, dan yang dia yakin berjarak dua hari di belakangnya."

#: script/events/room.js:1751
msgid "she has done something to her hand and has not mentioned it, and has been working one-handed for long enough that you only notice now."
msgstr "dia telah melakukan sesuatu pada tangannya dan belum menyebutkannya, dan telah bekerja dengan satu tangan cukup lama sehingga kau baru menyadarinya sekarang."

#: script/events/room.js:1755
msgid "she has hurt her hand and said nothing"
msgstr "dia melukai tangannya dan tak mengatakan apa-apa"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1724
msgid "she has more than she can use and no way to stop making it."
msgstr "dia punya lebih banyak dari yang bisa dia gunakan dan tak ada cara untuk berhenti membuatnya."

#: script/space.js:1079
msgid "she has never mentioned being able to do that.<br>you have never seen her do anything like it."
msgstr "dia tak pernah menyebutkan bisa melakukan itu.<br>kau tak pernah melihatnya melakukan apa pun seperti itu."

#: script/outside.js:1049
msgid "she hasn't completely escaped the dream. some of the terror remains in her face."
msgstr "dia belum sepenuhnya lepas dari mimpi itu. sebagian teror masih tersisa di wajahnya."

#: script/space.js:1007
#: script/space.js:1095
msgid "she holds it together long enough. the drives catch."
msgstr "dia menahannya cukup lama. penggeraknya menyala."

#: script/builder.js:146
msgid "she is careful with it in a way she is not careful with iron or coal. says she has seen what happens when this is stored wrong, and does not say where."
msgstr "dia berhati-hati dengannya dengan cara yang tidak dia lakukan pada besi atau batu bara. dia berkata dia pernah melihat apa yang terjadi saat ini disimpan dengan salah, dan tak mengatakan di mana."

#: script/space.js:1100
msgid "she is doing too much at once and you can see the moment it starts to come apart."
msgstr "dia melakukan terlalu banyak sekaligus dan kau bisa melihat saat itu mulai berantakan."

#: script/builder.js:173
msgid "she is quiet for long enough that you think she is not going to say anything. then: that every name on a stone like that was a person who trusted somebody, once, right up until the point where trusting them was the mistake that killed them."
msgstr "dia diam cukup lama sehingga kau berpikir dia tak akan mengatakan apa pun. lalu: bahwa setiap nama pada batu seperti itu adalah seseorang yang pernah memercayai orang lain, sampai pada titik di mana memercayai mereka adalah kesalahan yang membunuh mereka."

#: script/space.js:1004
#: script/space.js:1090
msgid "she is working eight stations at once and touching none of them.<br>readouts move. locks release. the drives come up."
msgstr "dia mengoperasikan delapan stasiun sekaligus dan tak menyentuh satu pun.<br>tampilan bergerak. kunci-kunci terbuka. penggerak-penggerak menyala."

#: script/outside.js:1120
msgid "she isn't very talkative and that is fine by you."
msgstr "dia tidak terlalu banyak bicara dan itu tak masalah bagimu."

#: script/events/room.js:1245
msgid "she leaves three pages behind, torn out at the spine."
msgstr "dia meninggalkan tiga halaman, terkoyak dari punggung buku."

#: script/events/room.js:1777
msgid "she lets you do it, which takes longer than the doing."
msgstr "dia membiarkanmu melakukannya, yang memakan waktu lebih lama dari melakukannya sendiri."

#: script/builder.js:210
msgid "she listens to the whole of it without interrupting. says somebody built that, and lived in it, and is not there now. says this rock is mostly other people's endings."
msgstr "dia mendengarkan semuanya tanpa menyela. dia berkata seseorang membangun itu, dan tinggal di dalamnya, dan sudah tak ada di sana sekarang. dia berkata batu ini sebagian besar adalah akhir-akhir kehidupan orang lain."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1702
msgid "she looks at you for a while longer than is comfortable."
msgstr "dia menatapmu untuk sesaat yang lebih lama dari yang nyaman."

#: script/outside.js:1050
msgid "she looks away from you."
msgstr "dia mengalihkan pandangan darimu."

#: script/easterEggs.js:73
msgid "she mentions, without looking up, that her name is Ayla. she does not bring it up again."
msgstr "dia menyebutkan, tanpa mengangkat kepala, bahwa namanya Ayla. dia tak pernah menyebutkannya lagi."

#: script/events/room.js:1188
msgid "she nods like she expected it, and does not write anything."
msgstr "dia mengangguk seolah dia sudah menduganya, dan tak menulis apa pun."

#: script/room.js:2128
msgid "she nods, and does not say anything for a bit, and then says good."
msgstr "dia mengangguk, dan tak mengatakan apa pun untuk sesaat, lalu berkata bagus."

#: script/room.js:2113
msgid "she puts the plans down and does not pick them back up."
msgstr "dia meletakkan rencana-rencana itu dan tak mengambilnya kembali."

#: script/events/road.js:629
msgid "she said kindness is rare here, but appreciated. she heard good things of you as of late."
msgstr "dia berkata kebaikan itu langka di sini, tapi dihargai. dia mendengar hal-hal baik tentangmu belakangan ini."

#: script/events/road.js:631
msgid "she said someone found her hidden water cache and raided it. there was no contigency plan beyond that."
msgstr "dia berkata seseorang menemukan persediaan air tersembunyinya dan menjarahnya. tak ada rencana cadangan setelah itu."

#: script/events/road.js:658
msgid "she says east was fine for nine days and then stopped being a direction."
msgstr "dia berkata timur baik-baik saja selama sembilan hari lalu berhenti menjadi sebuah arah."

#: script/events/road.js:1571
msgid "she says if you knew what she knew, you would be kneeling and holding like her."
msgstr "dia berkata jika kau tahu apa yang dia tahu, kau akan berlutut dan bertahan sepertinya."

#: script/events/road.js:1572
msgid "she says if you wait long enough the Infinite Expanse cycle will restart."
msgstr "dia berkata jika kau menunggu cukup lama siklus Bentangan Tak Berhingga akan dimulai ulang."

#: script/events/room.js:1805
msgid "she says it is fine and you agree that it is fine and the subject is closed."
msgstr "dia berkata itu baik-baik saja dan kau setuju itu baik-baik saja dan topiknya ditutup."

#: script/events/room.js:1753
msgid "she says it is fine. it is visibly not fine."
msgstr "dia berkata itu baik-baik saja. jelas terlihat tidak baik-baik saja."

#: script/outside.js:1236
msgid "she says it is kind kind to ask, but some things are best left unsaid."
msgstr "dia berkata baik bertanya, tapi ada hal-hal yang lebih baik tidak dikatakan."

#: script/events/road.js:1574
msgid "she says it is mostly silence where voices and signals once were."
msgstr "dia berkata sekarang sebagian besar hanya keheningan di tempat suara dan sinyal dulu berada."

#: script/events/road.js:657
msgid "she says nothing is east. says she checked."
msgstr "dia berkata tak ada apa pun di timur. dia berkata dia sudah memeriksanya."

#: script/events/road.js:1568
msgid "she says she is holding. she says holding is the whole of it and there is nothing after holding."
msgstr "dia berkata dia bertahan. dia berkata bertahan adalah keseluruhannya dan tak ada apa pun setelah bertahan."

#: script/events/road.js:1567
msgid "she says she is waiting to be told she can stop. she says the order has not been given."
msgstr "dia berkata dia menunggu diberitahu bahwa dia bisa berhenti. dia berkata perintah itu belum diberikan."

#: script/events/road.js:627
msgid "she says she stopped to think and could not work out how to start again. she says it took hours to notice."
msgstr "dia berkata dia berhenti untuk berpikir dan tak bisa mencari tahu cara memulai lagi. dia berkata butuh berjam-jam untuk menyadarinya."

#: script/events/road.js:1570
msgid "she says she was told to wait here and that the person who told her was extremely clear about it."
msgstr "dia berkata dia diberitahu untuk menunggu di sini dan orang yang memberitahunya sangat jelas tentang itu."

#: script/events/room.js:1218
msgid "she says the entry is not hers. it was already in the book when the book came to her."
msgstr "dia berkata entri itu bukan miliknya. sudah ada di buku itu saat buku itu sampai padanya."

#: script/events/road.js:1573
msgid "she says the Mysterious Wanderer can answer better than she can."
msgstr "dia berkata Pengembara Misterius dapat menjawab lebih baik dari dirinya."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1694
msgid "she says the village is just over there. she gestures at a direction with nothing in it."
msgstr "dia berkata desa itu ada di sana. dia menunjuk ke sebuah arah yang tak ada apa-apa di sana."

#: script/events/outside.js:999
msgid "she says there are a great many of these. she says she has been walking past them her whole life."
msgstr "dia berkata ada banyak sekali hal seperti ini. dia berkata dia telah berjalan melewatinya seumur hidupnya."

#: script/events/road.js:659
msgid "she says there is nothing east, and then corrects herself, and says there is nothing east that stays where it is."
msgstr "dia berkata tak ada apa pun di timur, lalu mengoreksi dirinya sendiri, dan berkata tak ada apa pun di timur yang tetap di tempatnya."

#: script/events/road.js:660
msgid "she says things that were east disappeared and other things that were east reappeared."
msgstr "dia berkata hal-hal yang berada di timur menghilang dan hal-hal lain yang berada di timur muncul kembali."

#: script/events/room.js:1227
msgid "she says whoever wrote it had been here long enough to stop expecting to leave."
msgstr "dia berkata siapa pun yang menulisnya telah berada di sini cukup lama untuk berhenti berharap bisa pergi."

#: script/outside.js:1185
msgid "she seems confused when you ask as if you should know."
msgstr "dia tampak bingung saat kau bertanya seolah kau seharusnya tahu."

#: script/outside.js:1011
#: script/outside.js:1067
msgid "she sees you there staring at her."
msgstr "dia melihatmu di sana menatapnya."

#: script/outside.js:1222
msgid "she should be direct and speak up or not speak at all."
msgstr "dia seharusnya langsung dan berbicara terus terang atau tidak berbicara sama sekali."

#: script/outside.js:1065
msgid "she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she screams that the exile doomed us all."
msgstr "dia mulai berbicara. dia bergumam tentang sebuah perang. dia berteriak bahwa sang buangan membinasakan kita semua."

#: script/outside.js:1010
msgid "she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she shrieks about human blood on her hands and finally bolts upright and awake."
msgstr "dia mulai berbicara. dia bergumam tentang sebuah perang. dia menjerit tentang darah manusia di tangannya dan akhirnya bangun tegak dan terjaga secara tiba-tiba."

#: script/events/road.js:685
msgid "she stopped walking a good while before she ran out of anything."
msgstr "dia berhenti berjalan jauh sebelum kehabisan apa pun."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1723
msgid "she takes the fur without counting it and loads you up past what the fur was worth."
msgstr "dia mengambil bulu itu tanpa menghitungnya dan memberimu lebih dari nilai bulu itu."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1726
msgid "she trades generously"
msgstr "dia berdagang dengan murah hati"

#: script/builder.js:138
msgid "she turns the ore over in both hands before she says anything. says whoever dug this vein meant it to still be findable. says that is a strange thing to plan for, and a stranger thing to be grateful for."
msgstr "dia membolak-balikkan bijih itu di kedua tangannya sebelum mengatakan apa pun. dia berkata siapa pun yang menggali urat ini bermaksud agar tetap bisa ditemukan. dia berkata itu hal yang aneh untuk direncanakan, dan hal yang lebih aneh lagi untuk disyukuri."

#: script/events/room.js:1169
msgid "she turns the page. there are forty names on it, in nine hands, and none of them agree."
msgstr "dia membalik halamannya. ada empat puluh nama di sana, dengan sembilan tulisan tangan, dan tak satu pun sesuai."

#: script/events/outside.js:995
msgid "she turns the stone over looking for a mason's mark and finds one, scratched rather than cut."
msgstr "dia membalik batu itu mencari tanda tukang batu dan menemukan satu, digores alih-alih dipotong."

#: script/events/road.js:630
msgid "she was coming to terms with the end, and now has to process what comes next."
msgstr "dia sedang menerima kenyataan akan akhir, dan sekarang harus memahami apa yang datang selanjutnya."

#: script/events/room.js:1167
msgid "she writes it down without looking up. asks how long that has been the name."
msgstr "dia menuliskannya tanpa mengangkat kepala. bertanya sudah berapa lama itu menjadi namanya."

#: script/events/encounters.js:97
msgid "shell splits"
msgstr "cangkang terbelah"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:469
msgid "shielded"
msgstr "terlindungi"

#: script/ship.js:33
msgid "Ship"
msgstr "Kapal"

#: script/events/encounters.js:523
msgid "shivering human"
msgstr "manusia menggigil"

#: script/world.js:94
msgid "shoot"
msgstr "tembak"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1295
msgid "should be able to open it."
msgstr "seharusnya bisa membukanya."

#: script/room.js:403
msgid "should cure the meat, or it'll spoil. builder says she can fix something up."
msgstr "asapi daging, atau ia akan membusuk. pembangun mengatakan dia dapat melakukannya."

#: script/events/road.js:609
msgid "shout and keep going"
msgstr "berteriak dan terus berjalan"

#: script/events/executioner.js:515
msgid "shuffling noises can be heard from within."
msgstr "suara seretan dapat terdengar dari dalam."

#: script/events/outside.js:226
msgid "Sickness"
msgstr "Penyakit"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1228
msgid "siege automaton"
msgstr "automaton pengepung"

#: script/events/road.js:1514
msgid "sight along the way they face"
msgstr "membidik ke arah yang mereka hadapi"

#: script/events/path.js:123
msgid "since after the meal, they say, and then cannot agree on which meal."
msgstr "sejak setelah makan, kata mereka, lalu tak bisa sepakat makan yang mana."

#: script/events/road.js:1729
msgid "sit and watch it"
msgstr "duduk dan mengamatinya"

#: script/events/room.js:1643
msgid "sit with it"
msgstr "duduk bersamanya"

#: script/outside.js:1064
msgid "siting in silence, ignoring the builder's suffering."
msgstr "duduk dalam diam, mengabaikan penderitaan pembangun."

#: script/outside.js:1009
msgid "sitting in silence, ignoring the builder`s suffering."
msgstr "duduk dalam diam, mengabaikan penderitaan pembangun."

#: script/events/road.js:115
msgid "sixty-one trips ended at this pile"
msgstr "enam puluh satu perjalanan berakhir di tumpukan ini"

#: script/events/road.js:100
#: script/events/road.js:107
msgid "sixty-one."
msgstr "enam puluh satu."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:355
msgid "skitter"
msgstr "berlarian kecil"

#: script/world.js:76
msgid "slash"
msgstr "ayun"

#: script/outside.js:585
msgid "slave"
msgstr "budak"

#: script/outside.js:581
msgid "slaves"
msgstr "budak-budak"

#: script/events/room.js:1655
msgid "sleep"
msgstr "tidur"

#: script/world.js:88
msgid "slice"
msgstr "iris"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1536
msgid "slipped past an automated sentry."
msgstr "berhasil melewati sentinel otomatis."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2090
msgid "slipped through unnoticed."
msgstr "lolos tanpa disadari."

#: script/dropbox.js:451
msgid "slot {0}: {1}"
msgstr "slot {0}: {1}"

#: script/dropbox.js:452
msgid "slot {0}: empty"
msgstr "slot {0}: kosong"

#: script/engine.js:37
msgid "slow metabolism"
msgstr "metabolisme lambat"

#: script/graveyard.js:95
msgid "small coffins weigh the heaviest"
msgstr "peti mati kecil terasa paling berat"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1423
msgid "small sensors in the walls still look to be operational."
msgstr "sensor-sensor kecil di dinding masih tampak beroperasi."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2384
msgid "small weapons cache in a cabinet."
msgstr "gudang senjata kecil dalam sebuah lemari."

#: script/events/room.js:1315
msgid "smash it"
msgstr "menghancurkannya"

#: script/room.js:400
#: script/room.js:425
msgid "smokehouse"
msgstr "rumah asap"

#: script/room.js:1489
msgid "smoldering"
msgstr "menyala kecil"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4388
#: script/events/setpieces.js:5400
msgid "snarling"
msgstr "menggeram"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1092
msgid "sniper"
msgstr "penembak jitu"

#: script/events/global.js:116
msgid "so are the shelves."
msgstr "begitu pula rak-raknya."

#: script/events/outside.js:113
msgid "so dependent on fire for warmth and life until it takes it away."
msgstr "begitu bergantung pada api untuk kehangatan dan kehidupan sampai ia merenggutnya kembali."

#: script/space.js:1111
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>some wanderer ships. some others.<br>sky begins to clear into an endless expanse."
msgstr "begitu banyak puing kapal-kapal mati dari perang yang sudah lama hilang.<br>sebagian kapal pengembara. sebagian yang lain.<br>langit mulai membersih menjadi bentangan tanpa akhir."

#: script/space.js:1065
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>the sky opens out, and there is nobody aboard but the two of you."
msgstr "begitu banyak puing kapal-kapal mati dari perang yang sudah lama hilang.<br>langit terbuka lebar, dan tak ada seorang pun di atas kapal selain kalian berdua."

#: script/room.js:2091
msgid "so they have somewhere to be kept"
msgstr "agar mereka punya tempat untuk ditampung"

#: script/room.js:2082
msgid "so they have somewhere to belong"
msgstr "agar mereka punya tempat untuk dimiliki"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3261
msgid "so what happened to them"
msgstr "lalu apa yang terjadi pada mereka"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1012
msgid "soldier"
msgstr "tentara"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7076
msgid "soldiers patrol the perimeter, rifles slung over their shoulders."
msgstr "tentara-tentara berpatroli di garis pertahanan, dengan senapan-senapan di bahu mereka."

#: script/events/outside.js:236
msgid "some {0} are ill"
msgstr "beberapa {0} sakit"

#: script/events/outside.js:144
msgid "some {0} have died"
msgstr "beberapa {0} telah mati"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2963
msgid "some are missing. others are closer than they ought to be."
msgstr "beberapa hilang. yang lain lebih dekat dari seharusnya."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2224
msgid "some completed explosives in the corner."
msgstr "beberapa bahan peledak jadi di sudut."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6248
msgid "some good stuff woven into its nest."
msgstr "beberapa benda berharga ditemukan di sarangnya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4936
msgid "some medicine abandoned in the drawers."
msgstr "beberapa obat ditinggalkan di dalam laci."

#: script/events/road.js:452
msgid "some of the tracks shift from two feet to crawling and then being dragged away."
msgstr "beberapa jejak berubah dari dua kaki menjadi merangkak lalu diseret pergi."

#: script/events/outside.js:13
msgid "some of the traps have been torn apart."
msgstr "beberapa jebakan telah dihancurkan."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1591
msgid "some of them are fixed and will not move. the rest turn under a fingertip."
msgstr "sebagian dari mereka tetap dan tak akan bergerak. sisanya berputar di bawah ujung jari."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1885
msgid "some of them are human. some of them are wanderers. none of them appear to consider this worth remarking on."
msgstr "sebagian dari mereka manusia. sebagian dari mereka pengembara. tak satu pun dari mereka tampak menganggap ini layak dikomentari."

#: script/events/outside.js:208
msgid "some of them are not anywhere."
msgstr "sebagian dari mereka tak ada di mana pun."

#: script/events/outside.js:207
msgid "some of them are still outside the wall in the morning."
msgstr "sebagian dari mereka masih di luar dinding pada pagi hari."

#: script/events/road.js:1533
msgid "some of them have been kneeling long enough that the ground has come up around their knees."
msgstr "sebagian dari mereka telah berlutut cukup lama sehingga tanahnya telah naik di sekitar lutut mereka."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3080
msgid "some of what it protected was worth protecting."
msgstr "sebagian dari apa yang dilindunginya memang layak dilindungi."

#: script/space.js:1072
msgid "some part of you wonders whether you escaped at all,<br>or whether this is only the part where you get to leave."
msgstr "sebagian dirimu bertanya-tanya apakah kau benar-benar melarikan diri,<br>atau apakah ini hanya bagian di mana kau boleh pergi."

#: script/events/outside.js:22
msgid "some traps have been destroyed"
msgstr "beberapa jebakan telah dirusak"

#: script/events/room.js:1029
msgid "some weird glowing boxes he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "beberapa kotak berpijar yang dipungut selama perjalanannya."

#: script/events/room.js:1013
msgid "some weird metal he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "logam aneh yang dipungut selama perjalanannya"

#: script/events/room.js:262
#: script/events/room.js:282
#: script/events/room.js:302
msgid "some wood is missing."
msgstr "beberapa kayu menghilang."

#: script/events/path.js:722
msgid "somebody built these huts out of a thing that came down here. a long time before anybody in this village did."
msgstr "seseorang membangun gubuk-gubuk ini dari sesuatu yang jatuh ke sini. jauh sebelum siapa pun di desa ini melakukannya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3079
msgid "somebody catalogued what they saw coming and then drew up what a settlement would need to survive it. both answers. they did not choose."
msgstr "seseorang mengkatalogkan apa yang mereka lihat akan datang lalu menyusun apa yang dibutuhkan sebuah permukiman untuk bertahan darinya. kedua jawaban. mereka tidak memilih."

#: script/events/road.js:918
msgid "somebody comes here. regularly. and then goes back the way they came."
msgstr "seseorang datang ke sini. secara rutin. lalu kembali dengan cara yang sama seperti kedatangannya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3165
msgid "somebody dug here before. what is left of their kit is folded into the layer they stopped at."
msgstr "seseorang menggali di sini sebelumnya. sisa perlengkapannya terlipat ke dalam lapisan tempat mereka berhenti."

#: script/events/road.js:320
msgid "somebody else has had this same idea, in this same spot, a great many times."
msgstr "orang lain pernah memiliki ide yang sama, di tempat yang sama, sangat banyak kali."

#: script/events/road.js:152
msgid "somebody else's snares, with a catch in them"
msgstr "jerat milik orang lain, dengan tangkapan di dalamnya"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3553
msgid "somebody has been at the last panel with a tool. the line about the people already living on those worlds is gouged out, and it was gouged out from the inside, by somebody who was locked in here."
msgstr "seseorang pernah berada di panel terakhir dengan sebuah alat. baris tentang orang-orang yang sudah tinggal di dunia-dunia itu terkikis, dan itu terkikis dari dalam, oleh seseorang yang terkunci di sini."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2655
msgid "somebody has been comparing something against something older, over and over, for a very long time, and writing down how far it has moved."
msgstr "seseorang telah membandingkan sesuatu dengan sesuatu yang lebih tua, berulang-ulang, untuk waktu yang sangat lama, dan mencatat seberapa jauh itu telah bergeser."

#: script/events/room.js:1693
msgid "somebody has been counting the prints"
msgstr "seseorang telah menghitung jejak-jejak itu"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2995
msgid "somebody has been watching this sky, in shifts, across more successors than any one people could account for."
msgstr "seseorang telah mengamati langit ini, secara bergiliran, melalui lebih banyak generasi penerus daripada yang bisa dihitung satu orang pun."

#: script/events/road.js:108
msgid "somebody has come out this far sixty-one times and put something on this pile, and gone back."
msgstr "seseorang telah datang sejauh ini enam puluh satu kali dan meletakkan sesuatu di tumpukan ini, lalu kembali."

#: script/events/path.js:274
msgid "somebody has laid a line of stones along the edge of the path, running out towards the flats."
msgstr "seseorang telah meletakkan sederet batu di sepanjang tepi jalur, membentang menuju dataran."

#: script/graveyard.js:69
msgid "somebody has scratched an addition under the carved text, much later and much worse."
msgstr "seseorang telah menggores tambahan di bawah teks yang terpahat, jauh kemudian dan jauh lebih buruk."

#: script/events/road.js:322
msgid "somebody has waited out this stretch before"
msgstr "seseorang pernah menunggu di tempat ini sebelumnya"

#: script/village.js:77
msgid "somebody is at the door, out of breath, and does not knock first."
msgstr "ada seseorang di pintu, kehabisan napas, dan tak mengetuk lebih dulu."

#: script/events/road.js:595
msgid "somebody is sitting down out on the flats"
msgstr "ada seseorang duduk di dataran itu"

#: script/events/path.js:212
msgid "somebody presses a thumb into a handful of it and the print is still there in the morning, perfect."
msgstr "seseorang menekankan ibu jari ke dalam segenggam itu dan cetakannya masih ada di pagi hari, sempurna."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3621
msgid "somebody says her name and she does not look up, and the name goes past you before you can hold on to it."
msgstr "seseorang menyebut namanya dan dia tak mengangkat kepala, dan nama itu berlalu di depanmu sebelum kau bisa menahannya."

#: script/events/road.js:1209
msgid "somebody sealed this from the other side."
msgstr "seseorang menyegel ini dari sisi lain."

#: script/events/room.js:1220
msgid "somebody translated it underneath, a long time after."
msgstr "seseorang menerjemahkannya di bawahnya, lama setelahnya."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3571
msgid "somebody was held here through a trial"
msgstr "seseorang ditahan di sini selama sebuah pengadilan"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3566
msgid "somebody was held here through a trial. the marks on the floor are a man walking the same four paces for a long time."
msgstr "seseorang ditahan di sini selama sebuah pengadilan. tanda-tanda di lantai adalah seorang pria berjalan empat langkah yang sama dalam waktu yang lama."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3281
msgid "somebody was let out, a long way from here, and this is one of the places that cost."
msgstr "seseorang dibebaskan, jauh dari sini, dan ini adalah salah satu tempat yang menjadi harganya."

#: script/events/road.js:564
msgid "somebody with your hand has signed this stone five times. you are signing it for the first time."
msgstr "seseorang dengan tulisan tanganmu telah menandatangani batu ini lima kali. kau menandatanganinya untuk pertama kalinya."

#: script/prison.js:222
msgid "someone drew a symbol in this cell. it looks like your charms."
msgstr "seseorang menggambar sebuah simbol di sel ini. tampak seperti jimat-jimatmu."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6660
msgid "someone had been stockpiling loot here."
msgstr "seseorang telah menimbun hasil jarahan di sini."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5600
msgid "someone has locked and barricaded the door to this operating theatre."
msgstr "seseorang telah mengunci dan memblokir pintu menuju kamar bedah ini."

#: script/events/room.js:1298
msgid "someone in the village has got an old receiver working."
